  "recallCost": 0,
  "rulesText": "When you’re tracking a specific creature or group of creatures based on signs of their passage, you can spend any number of Hope and ask the GM that many questions from the following list.\n\n  - What direction did they go?\n  - How long ago did they pass through?\n  - What were they doing in this location?\n  - How many of them were here?\n\nWhen you encounter creatures you’ve tracked in this way, gain a +1 bonus to your Evasion against them.",
